    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Light sphere (Searing Light (light)), caster level 5th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your Searing Light now deals 1 point of untyped damage per caster level per round in addition to its fire damage. Undead, oozes, and creatures harmed by daylight take 2 additional points of untyped damage per caster level per round instead.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/light#toc89\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
